{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_87_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_87","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_87_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_87","textTraditional":"二、夏，狄伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_87_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_87","textTraditional":"三、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_87_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_87","textTraditional":"四、冬，天王出居鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_87_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_87","textTraditional":"王者無外，此其言出何？不能乎母也。魯子曰：「是王也，不能乎母者，其諸此之謂與。」","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_87_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_87","textTraditional":"五、晉侯夷吾卒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}